{"4790660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moose Builders", "steam_appid": 4790660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4931800, 5124910], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig sand with a shovel and process into iron, silicon and more. Craft and merge better tools and machines to build solar panels to power them. Research new machines to automate everything in multi-story factories. Play alone or with friends to survive in the desert and turn it into a solar farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig and process</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig sand and stone and use crushers, filtering machines and furnaces to process it into iron, silicon, copper, aluminium and more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft new and better tools to dig faster. Craft new and more machines to craft new things.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Merge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge four of the same tool or machine into one upgraded version. Merging tools increases the tool digging area, merging machines make them faster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your nutrition and hydration level and watch out for the heat from the sun. Failing to do so can lead to an untimely death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Automate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft pipes to transport items between machines and craft lava extractors to get resources automatically from the ground. Automate everything in a large factory.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-world:</strong> Large voxel based desert(64km2) to build your solar farm and factory in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online-coop:</strong> Play alone to manage everything yourself or invite your friends to help you build the largest factory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge (almost) anything:</strong> Merge four of the same tool or machine to make a better one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research:</strong> Unlock new materials, machines and tools through research</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voxel-based world:</strong> Shape the world as you want by digging and placing blocks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical factories:</strong> Use machines and pipes to automate the crafting of anything and expand it in three dimensions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival mechanics:</strong> Craft different tiers and types of foods and drinks to combat the harsh desert environment</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig sand with a shovel and process into iron, silicon and more. Craft and merge better tools and machines to build solar panels to power them. Research new machines to automate everything in multi-story factories. Play alone or with friends to survive in the desert and turn it into a solar farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig and process</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig sand and stone and use crushers, filtering machines and furnaces to process it into iron, silicon, copper, aluminium and more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft new and better tools to dig faster. Craft new and more machines to craft new things.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Merge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge four of the same tool or machine into one upgraded version. Merging tools increases the tool digging area, merging machines make them faster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your nutrition and hydration level and watch out for the heat from the sun. Failing to do so can lead to an untimely death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Automate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft pipes to transport items between machines and craft lava extractors to get resources automatically from the ground. Automate 